<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have intensified attacks, prompting fresh violence that has forced over 7,000 people to flee their homes. The insurgents killed a woman and a blogger while livestreaming and later released captured fishermen after a hostage situation. Qatar and Mozambique held political consultations, and Russia noted updated bilateral relations with Mozambique. Alarm has risen over growing synthetic drug manufacturing linked to Kenya, Nigeria and Mozambique. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNeTk3THVEZldXWWs3SnkyV0Rfd1puS2ZMRktpeWxGbzhtTEwwNEkzOWlER2JNcllwOC1Ub1NIT3h5aGM1ZHg5dS1CZUlsUUZ4TFVLNGNfTzZzRlVrcU9xZGNPaTlBMWNycXpIYjBIc3lDWW1aNDFodVZLZ0tLTVZ2bUlKMmNCMldMRUNJaHB5a0J5MXdKMkhfSEJhdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Britannica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTFB1eG5hNUJNNzFqUzRrejBSeWhUQUFQaUFQejZPVUFiakRuZklDdHQwNHJsdFZqeFh0N01RWGFZNGNIUDE2Z2c4RnljdHdqVmJtRGRBOHRHZWp0Y3paR3d0MQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOc1ZBZDJjVzlNOHlmQ3ZjUGlCaUZ1Qm02SFlYeWlXVFVZYWlwOGhyVFhYNjNucTUyY012Q284QzZhaWZ0YnRUVXM0VmEwNlBxb0JQbTNuY0RPY1pScVFiNFFJdUdsYUYzNkJBNjVRQmtCOVRoX0lQcjNpdE1UV1FzRUhZYWdOTmFwYi05MGVCcndDRjdyQ052dHFWa3Z4NW9Xa3c2MEVGeVRVbUU2YmhqUUtqanMtVHV5T054Zl93?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95c